<p>Sustainability Team, Purchasing, Factory Management, CEO:</p>

<p>IKEA's Supply Chain Sustainability (SCS) division has completed its annual <b>FSC (Forest Stewardship Council)</b> and <b>IWAY</b> (IKEA Way of Purchasing) audit of your manufacturing facility. Your certification has been placed in <b style="color:#e00">probationary status</b> due to supply chain traceability concerns. A <b>Sustainability Premium</b> payment is required to maintain your preferred supplier status.</p>

