<h3>二、Findings (Score Reductions)</h3>

<p><b>Finding 1 — Supply Chain Traceability Gap (-6 points)</b></p>
<p>IKEA requires full chain-of-custody documentation for all wood-based materials (packaging, pallets, documentation inserts). Your facility could not provide FSC certificates for:</p>
<ul>
<li>Corrugated cardboard packaging (3 suppliers, 18,400 boxes/month)</li>
<li>Wooden pallets (2 suppliers, 420 pallets/month)</li>
<li>Product manuals printed on non-certified paper</li>
</ul>

<p><b>Finding 2 — Energy Auditing Deficiency (-3 points)</b></p>
<p>Your facility has not conducted an ISO 50001 energy audit in the last 24 months (required every 12 months for IKEA suppliers with >500 employees).</p>

<p><b>Finding 3 — Chemical Management Gaps (-3 points)</b></p>
<p>Two chemical substances (used in enclosure coating) lack REACH SVHC (Substances of Very High Concern) declarations.</p>

